    Bug 1985223 - Move nsNewsFolder authentication methods into JS and use async nsILoginManager methods. r=mkmelin
    This doesn't feel great but the JS code is better at dealing with async methods.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295234

